{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25775","headline":"过锺陵 · 李绅","name":"过锺陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙沙江尾抱锺陵，水郭村桥晚景澄。\n江对楚山千里月，郭连渔浦万家灯。\n省抛双斾辞荣宠，遽落丹霄起爱憎。\n惆怅旧游同草露，却思恩顾一沾膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}